@startuml AnalytiCore_Deployment_Diagram
title AnalytiCore Note App — Deployment Diagram (Prototype Execution Environment)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  BorderColor #059669
}

actor "Local User" as User

node "Demo Host Workstation\n(loopback-bound services)" as Host {

  node "Web Browser\n(ES2022 module support)" as Browser {
    artifact "AnalytiCore SPA\n(React / TypeScript bundle)" as SPA
    artifact "ollama/browser SDK" as OllamaSDK
  }

  node "Node.js Process\nExpress API\n127.0.0.1:3002" as ApiNode {
    artifact "server/index.mjs\n+ document CRUD" as ApiArtifact
    artifact "Built SPA static files\n(dist/) — production only" as Dist <<optional>>
  }

  node "Vite Dev Server\n127.0.0.1:3000\n(development only)" as ViteNode <<optional>> {
    artifact "Vite HMR + /api proxy" as ViteProxy
  }

  node "Docker / Colima Runtime" as DockerNode {
    database "MySQL 8.4 Container\n127.0.0.1:${MYSQL_PORT:-3307}→3306\nDB: analyticore" as MySQL
    artifact "Volume:\nanalyticore-mysql" as Volume
  }

  node "Ollama Host Process\n(not managed by docker-compose)" as OllamaNode {
    artifact "LLM Runtime\nLlama 3 / selected model\ndefault :11434" as Llama
  }
}

User --> Browser : use UI\nhttp://127.0.0.1:3000 (dev)\nor http://127.0.0.1:3002 (prod)

' Development execution path
Browser --> ViteNode : HTTP :3000
ViteProxy --> ApiArtifact : proxy /api/* → :3002

' Production execution path
Browser --> ApiNode : HTTP :3002\n(SPA + /api same origin)
ApiArtifact --> Dist : serves static assets\nwhen dist/ present

' Persistence
ApiArtifact --> MySQL : mysql2 TCP\n127.0.0.1:3307
MySQL --> Volume : durable storage

' Emerging technology
SPA --> OllamaSDK : chat requests
OllamaSDK --> Llama : HTTP Ollama API\n(ApiConfig.hostUrl / model)

note right of ViteNode
  **Dev:** npm run db:up
  then npm run dev
  (API + Vite concurrently)
end note

note right of ApiNode
  **Prod:** npm run build
  then npm start
  Vite node not deployed
end note

note bottom of OllamaNode
  Emerging technology node.
  Start separately:
  ollama pull <model>
  ollama serve
end note

note bottom of DockerNode
  Only MySQL is containerised
  by this project's
  docker-compose.yml.
end note

@enduml
